r and transferring or directing calls to the correct area. View Details Bookmark Web Master SF2467P Information Technology - Troy Staff The Web Master position in Information Technology is responsible for assisting with the development and publication of web content, working directly with faculty and staff to provide continuous maintenance and improvements to the university’s intranet portal and related websites.This position reports directly to the Director of Web as part of a team that shares responsibilities and works collab... View Details Bookmark Weight Room Assistant SF2466P Sports Medicine - Troy Staff The Weight Room Assistant position in the Athletic Director’s Office is responsible for assisting with operating the weight room for student-athletes; assisting in teaching/training of sound techniques to insure the safety of student-athletes; working with athletic training staff to provide injury rehabilitation; and maintaining the cleanliness of the weight room. View Details Bookmark Lab Assistant SF2592P Chemistry and Physics - Troy Staff The primary focus of this project is to construct and implement a classification system for multiple STEM laboratories’ equipment and machines, inventory consumable and reusable laboratory equipment, design a laboratory set-up manual for STEM teaching assistants, and test/ edit reserve online STEM labs. View Details Bookmark Graduate Administrative Assistant- Creative Media ST1476P Marketing & Communications - Troy Student The Graduate Administrative Assistant position in Marketing & Communication is responsible for assisting in the visual story telling for TROY through compelling photography and video content. View Details Bookmark University Archivist SF2591P Library - Troy Staff The University Archivist position in the Library is a professional staff position and is responsible for serving as a senior advisor to university leadership in the development of the archives, and providing expertise in accepted standards and best practices of archival administration. View Details Bookmark Annual Giving & Special Projects Coordinator SF2590P Annual Giving Staff The Annual Giving & Special Projects Coordinator position supports the university’s annual giving program through donor stewardship, gift pipeline coordination, and appeals strategy, while also planning and executing special events that strengthen fundraising and donor engagement. This position plays a key role in advancing the office’s vision to enhance alumni engagement with the universit... View Details Bookmark College of Education Communication Coordinator SF2580P University Relations - Troy Staff The Communication Coordinator for the College of Education and Behavioral Sciences works closely with the Dean, department chairs, faculty, and other stakeholders under the direction of the Office of University Relations to develop and distribute strategic communications that advance public awareness of the College’s mission, programs, and impact.This position supports the College’s communicati... View Details Bookmark Public Radio Membership Officer SF2589P Broadcast and Digital Network - Troy Staff 09/11/2026 The Public Radio Membership Officer is responsible for supporting Troy Public Radio’s fundraising efforts by working with members of the station’s sustaining member program; assisting in planning the station’s regular fund drives and mail campaigns; and directly responsible for overseeing the fund drive call center. View Details Bookmark Band Event Staff - Office SF2588P Band - Troy Staff Work in Band Office as needed View Details Bookmark Academic Program Specialist SF2587P Hospitality, Sport, and Tourism Management - Troy Staff The Academic Program Specialist provides administrative support and manages a variety of academic and departmental processes for the School of Hospitality, Sport and Tourism Management, reporting to the Department Chair. This position is responsible for general office duties, scheduling, coordinating,