g potential student-athletes to participate on the baseball team; completing workouts for pitchers for the baseball team; and other duties as assigned. View Details Bookmark Workship - Scenic & Properties Shop Assistant ST1472P Theatre & Dance - Troy Student The Workship position for the Department of Theatre and Dance is responsible for serving as a properties shop assistant, lighting technician and/or scene shop technician, including but not limited to assisting in implementing lighting design or scenic design, set up, operation, and breakdown for sets, props, and/or lighting; and organization and upkeep of current inventory. View Details Bookmark Lecturer F1086P BSN Program - Troy Faculty The Lecturer of Nursing position is primarily responsible for teaching undergraduate nursing didactic and/or clinical courses, advising BSN students, maintaining involvement in University, College, School, BSN Program, and professional service, and contributing to the nursing body of knowledge through personal and collaborative scholarship. View Details Bookmark Senior Director of Institutional Research, Planning & Effectiveness SF2583P Institutional Research Planning and Effectiveness - Troy Staff The Director of Institutional Research, Planning & Effectiveness position typically oversees institutional effectiveness, assessment, accreditation, and data-driven decision-making across the university. The core responsibilities are:1. Institutional Effectiveness & AssessmentDevelop and maintain the institution’s comprehensive effectiveness frameworkCoordinate assessment of student lea... View Details Bookmark Workship ST1471P Academic Evaluation Center - Troy Student The Workship position in the Academic Evaluation Center is responsible for assisting the department with clerical duties, running errands, and will aid with Graduation Center or Records tasks, when needed. View Details Bookmark Tutor SF2582P International Programs - Troy Staff The Tutor position in International Programs is responsible for providing tutoring services to students in the public school system. View Details Bookmark Administrative Secretary SF2581P College of Arts and Humanities - Troy Staff Provide administrative support to dean’s office and departments of CCFA View Details Bookmark Workship ST1469P International Programs - Troy Student The Workship position in International Programs is responsible for assisting with the process of admitting and enrolling new international students; assisting international recruitment and admission efforts; general department support; and assisting with application processing, expediting issues, printing, filling, research, orientation assistant, language support on emails and phone. View Details Bookmark Go to search results page: Previous 1 2 3 4 5 6 7 8 Next - Employment is contingent upon a satisfactory background check. - Troy University is an Equal Employment Opportunity and Affirmative Action employer. - Troy University participates in eVerify. To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
